{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"环路群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"环路群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>一个群的环路群是指"},{"Local":{"url":"去心形式圆盘","text":"去心形式圆盘"}},{"Plain":"到它的映射构成的群.</p>\n"}]}}